# The rock wall by the road south of Akil's farm, the view `road-3` of landscape-rock-material.bench: the frame's
# GPU time of a rock material (reports/content/2026-11-landscape-pilot/b3-rock-material.md, task 1). Run with the
# set under test in PERF_ENV='OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<path on the host>'.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
goto NW_FARM2_TO_TAVERN_02
clear 3000
face wp NW_FARM2_TO_TAVERN_04
turn 180
# Twenty real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation (`streaming wait` times out under the
# normal clock)
wait 20000
cam hold
perf sample perf-rock/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
shot road-3
wait 200
# The grass tufts of the ledge right at the camera, the view `ledge-near` of the same scenario: what living foliage
# costs where its leaves fill the frame (reports/engine/2026-11-14-living-foliage); off with OPENGOTHIC_FOLIAGE=0
goto pos 35110 3829 429
clear 3000
cam at 34800 3990 900 34800 4040 1390
wait 20000
perf sample perf-rock/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
shot ledge-near
wait 200
